# Club personal data. The repository is public.
#
# `runner.dateOfBirth` is marked PRIVATE in the schema: it exists only to derive
# an age-grade standard and must never be published. sync-member-roster-2026.sql
# carries the real dates of birth of 63 named members, so it stays local — git
# history is permanent and public forks cannot be recalled. Run it from your
# machine; nothing in the deployment needs it.
scripts/sql/sync-member-roster-2026.sql

# Working data extracted from club results: names, times and age categories for
# named members. The public site keeps these behind SITE_PASSCODE, so they do
# not belong in a public repository either.
data/
